# Lair of the Hydra: "If you control two or more other lands, this land enters tapped" (CR 614.1d). On turn 3 Bot1 has one
# other land (a Forest) and Bot2 has an Island, which does not count ("you control"): the first Lair enters untapped and
# taps for {G}. On turn 5 Bot1 has two other lands (Forest, first Lair): the second Lair enters tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Lair of the Hydra
Lair of the Hydra
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Lair of the Hydra.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Lair of the Hydra.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Lair of the Hydra.Activate(Ability: Add)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Lair of the Hydra.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Lair of the Hydra#1.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Lair of the Hydra#2.Tapped = true
